  "merger_description": "Salesforce, Inc. (**Salesforce**) proposes to acquire 100% of the shares in Contentful Global, Inc. (**Contentful**).\n\nSalesforce is a global supplier of customer relationship management (**CRM**) software and other software-as-a-service solutions that enable companies to manage their relationships with customers. Salesforce\u2019s CRM platform assists users with sales, service, marketing and commerce functions.\n\nContentful is a global supplier of digital experience software, specifically, a content management system (**CMS**). Contentful\u2019s CMS is used by businesses to create, edit, organise and publish a company's digital content across various channels and platforms via Application Programming Interfaces (**API**). Contentful provides a 'headless' CMS product, meaning it stores and manages an organisation's content separately from the system that displays the content to the end user.",
